{"seq":2,"slug":"revenue-relevance-balance","title":"GMV 与相关性的平衡护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/global-effectiveness/revenue-relevance-balance","wordCount":2587,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"gmv-与相关性的平衡护栏\">GMV 与相关性的平衡护栏</h1><p>搜索团队每年都会被问同一个问题：「能不能把 GMV 高的商品往前放一点？」这个要求的短期收益是真实的，但它有一个隐含代价：搜索结果变差，用户下次少用搜索。护栏的作用就是<strong>把这个代价显式化</strong>，让「往前放一点」这件事有明确的边界和可观测的账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两股力量的动态平衡\">核心概念：两股力量的动态平衡</h2><p>搜索排序里同时存在两个目标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相关性</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>：结果与用户意图的匹配程度，决定用户能否找到想要的东西。</li>\n<li><strong>商业价值</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>：结果带来的期望收益（GMV、毛利、广告收入）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把它们写成一个复合目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\; \\mathbb{E}\\big[\\text{GMV}\\big] \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad R \\geq R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>约束形式比加权形式（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>GMV</mtext><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\; \\text{GMV} + \\lambda R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GMV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>）更适合做护栏，因为<strong>约束有明确的物理含义</strong>（相关性不得低于某水平），而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值没有直观解释，且随指标尺度漂移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[查询] --&gt; REL[相关性打分]&#10;    REL --&gt; G{护栏检查}&#10;    G --&gt;|R &gt;= R_min| BIZ[商业价值调整]&#10;    G --&gt;|R &lt; R_min| KEEP[保持相关性排序]&#10;    BIZ --&gt; OUT[最终排序]&#10;    KEEP --&gt; OUT&#10;    OUT --&gt; M[监控: 相关性/转化/长期指标]&#10;    M --&gt; G\">graph TD\n    Q[查询] --&gt; REL[相关性打分]\n    REL --&gt; G{护栏检查}\n    G --&gt;|R &gt;= R_min| BIZ[商业价值调整]\n    G --&gt;|R &lt; R_min| KEEP[保持相关性排序]\n    BIZ --&gt; OUT[最终排序]\n    KEEP --&gt; OUT\n    OUT --&gt; M[监控: 相关性/转化/长期指标]\n    M --&gt; G</pre><p>这里最关键的工程决策是：<strong>护栏是硬过滤还是软惩罚</strong>。硬过滤（相关性低于阈值的商品直接排除商业加成）能严格保证下限，但会造成「阈值附近商品的结果突变」——相关性 0.51 的商品有商业加成，0.49 的没有，相邻商品行为差异大。软惩罚（商业加成按相关性连续衰减）平滑但无法保证严格的硬下限。</p>\n<p>实际采用的通常是<strong>两者结合</strong>：绝对下限用硬过滤（低于它的商品完全不能获得任何商业加成，包括置顶与坑位），下限之上用软衰减：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>biz</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>σ</mi><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><mi>τ</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{\\text{biz}}(d) = \\Delta_{\\max} \\cdot \\sigma\\!\\left(\\frac{s_{\\text{rel}}(d) - R_{\\min}}{\\tau}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">biz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是 S 型函数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制衰减的陡峭程度。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{rel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，远高于时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta \\to \\Delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商业加成的可能来源清单\">商业加成的可能来源清单</h2><p>「商业价值」不是一个单一来源，把所有会引入商业偏向的机制列在一起，才能确保护栏覆盖完整。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>引入的偏向</th>\n<th>是否有运营意图</th>\n<th>护栏方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则加权</td>\n<td>直接提升商业商品分数</td>\n<td>是（显式）</td>\n<td>乘子上限 + 相关性门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活动坑位</td>\n<td>固定位置给活动商品</td>\n<td>是（显式）</td>\n<td>坑位比例上限 + 相关性门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告混排</td>\n<td>竞价商品进入头部</td>\n<td>是（竞价）</td>\n<td>骨架约束 + 相关性硬门槛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商家导向排序</td>\n<td>优先展示自营/高毛利商品</td>\n<td>是（策略）</td>\n<td>相关性门槛 + 多样性约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存导向</td>\n<td>优先展示有货商品</td>\n<td>是（合理）</td>\n<td>通常无需护栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>履约导向</td>\n<td>优先展示次日达商品</td>\n<td>是（合理）</td>\n<td>按相关性分档施加</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>上表前四行是需要护栏的，后两行通常不需要——因为它们提升商业价值的同时也提升用户体验（有货、快送）。判断一个偏向是否需要护栏，标准是<strong>它是否可能把一个低相关商品推到用户面前</strong>。库存与履约导向不会（它们只在相关商品集合内重排），而加权、坑位、广告可能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关性下限的设定\">相关性下限的设定</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的设定不能拍脑袋，它应该由<strong>用户体验指标</strong>反推。可用的标定方法有三种：</p>\n<p><strong>方法一：无结果率反推。</strong> 观测「相关性低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的商品被排除后，有多少查询的可用结果数少于 10 个」。如果这个比例过高（比如超过 2%），说明阈值太高，会导致用户在长尾查询上找不到东西。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：点击质量反推。</strong> 取一批曝光数据，把商品按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mtext>rel</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{\\text{rel}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rel</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分桶，观测每桶的转化率。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应设在「转化率显著高于随机」的最低桶边界。这个方法的依据是：低相关商品的点击往往带来低转化甚至差评，把它们的曝光换成高相关商品是双赢。</p>\n<p><strong>方法三：AB 实验。</strong> 直接实验不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下的 GMV 与相关性指标，取曲线拐点。这是最可靠的方法，但成本最高（需要足够流量与时间）。</p>\n<p>实践中先用品类分档的做法：不同品类的相关性分布与转化曲线不同，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应该按品类分别标定，而不是全局一个值。比如电子产品的相关性分普遍较高（属性明确），而服装的相关性分偏低于视觉差异大，用同一个阈值会让服装类过度受限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长期指标的监控清单\">长期指标的监控清单</h2><p>护栏的失效通常不会立刻显形——短期 GMV 上升、相关性略降是「好处先到、代价后到」的典型结构。因此必须有面向长期的监控。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>观测周期</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>恶化信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自然结果点击率</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>用户对非商业结果的兴趣</td>\n<td>持续下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话内搜索次数</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>用户是否反复换词找东西</td>\n<td>上升（说明搜不到）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次会话回访率</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>用户是否还愿意用搜索</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首位自然结果点击率</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>头部自然结果是否被商业内容拦截</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无结果率</td>\n<td>日</td>\n<td>是否有内容可以给</td>\n<td>上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索入口使用率</td>\n<td>周</td>\n<td>用户是否转去别处</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性人工评分</td>\n<td>月</td>\n<td>抽样人工判断</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最重要的组合是**「自然结果点击率 + 次会话回访率」**。自然结果点击率衡量用户是否跳过商业内容去找自然结果（如果一直在跳，说明商业内容没价值）；次会话回访率衡量长期的搜索信任。两者同时下降是明确的红线信号，需要立刻收紧护栏。</p>\n<p>监控的关键设计是<strong>按商业内容密度分桶</strong>。把所有流量混在一起看会掩盖问题——如果商业内容只在部分查询上密集（比如大促期间的热门词），整体指标可能看不出异常。按「本次请求中商业内容数量」分桶后，能直接看到密度高的桶与其他桶的指标差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"商业与相关性的联合优化\">商业与相关性的联合优化</h2><p>护栏之外，还有一个更进阶的做法：不把相关性当作固定约束，而是让商业调整<strong>自适应地</strong>随用户与上下文变化。核心思想是：不同场景下用户对商业内容的容忍度不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>商业内容容忍度</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>品牌词查询</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>用户已选定品牌，插入其他商品是干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长描述词查询</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>用户约束明确，想要精确匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目泛词查询</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>用户在自己探索，推荐有价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次会话</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>用户在校准搜索质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频复访用户</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>已知搜索能力，能自己绕过商业内容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套「容忍度分级」可以由规则配置（按查询类型）或由模型学习（用点击行为反推）。从规则配置起步更稳，因为它的行为可解释、可回滚。模型学习需要大量的点击数据，且容易学到「用户点了商业内容 = 他能容忍」的循环论证——但用户点击可能只是因为它在第一位。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[查询] --&gt; T{查询与用户类型}&#10;    T --&gt;|品牌词/首次会话| A1[低容忍: 收紧护栏]&#10;    T --&gt;|类目泛词/复访| A2[高容忍: 放宽护栏]&#10;    A1 --&gt; D[商业调整幅度]&#10;    A2 --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; C[硬护栏: 绝对下限]&#10;    C --&gt; O[排序]&#10;    O --&gt; M[长期监控]&#10;    M --&gt; T\">flowchart TD\n    Q[查询] --&gt; T{查询与用户类型}\n    T --&gt;|品牌词/首次会话| A1[低容忍: 收紧护栏]\n    T --&gt;|类目泛词/复访| A2[高容忍: 放宽护栏]\n    A1 --&gt; D[商业调整幅度]\n    A2 --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; C[硬护栏: 绝对下限]\n    C --&gt; O[排序]\n    O --&gt; M[长期监控]\n    M --&gt; T</pre><p>注意图中「硬护栏」仍然在所有路径之后——<strong>容忍度分级只调整软性幅度，不解除绝对下限</strong>。这是设计的底线：无论什么场景，把完全不相关的商品推到用户面前都是不可接受的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与个性化的交互\">与个性化的交互</h2><p>商业护栏和个性化有交互。如果某个用户历史上对某品牌特别偏好，系统会把该品牌商品前移——这个前移如果恰好与商业加成叠加，效果会放大。因此有两个需要显式处理的点：</p>\n<p><strong>点一：加成叠加的上限。</strong> 个性化加成与商业加成不应简单相加或相乘，而应有联合上限。实现上是在管道末端做一次总调整量的裁剪：任何商品相对其自然相关性的总位移（来自个性化 + 商业 + 规则）不超过预设上限。这与 <a href=\"../personalization/personalized-rerank\">在通用排序上的个性化重排</a> 提出的「位移上界」是同一个机制，区别是这里的上界要覆盖所有来源。</p>\n<p><strong>点二：商业内容的相关性判定不应被个性化污染。</strong> 判断一个商品「与查询相关」应该基于查询与商品的匹配，而不是「这个用户喜欢这个品牌」。否则个性化强的用户会看到更多低相关但符合其偏好的商品，而护栏失效。实现上，护栏检查用的相关分应该是<strong>与用户无关的查询-商品匹配分</strong>，与真实排序用的分数分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>商业与相关性的平衡用<strong>约束形式</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\geq R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）而非加权形式，因为约束有明确物理含义且不随尺度漂移。</li>\n<li>护栏用「绝对下限硬过滤 + 下限之上软衰减」结合；软衰减用 S 型函数让加成随相关性平滑变化。</li>\n<li>需要护栏的机制是加权、坑位、广告、商家导向排序；库存与履约导向通常不需要，因为它们只在相关集合内重排。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按品类分档标定，方法有无结果率反推、点击质量反推、AB 实验三种，优先用前两者建立基线再实验微调。</li>\n<li>长期监控的核心组合是「自然结果点击率 + 次会话回访率」，且必须按商业内容密度分桶看，否则整体指标会掩盖局部恶化。</li>\n<li>商业容忍度可按查询类型与会话阶段分级，但<strong>分级只调整软性幅度，不解除绝对下限</strong>。</li>\n<li>个性化与商业加成必须共用联合位移上限；护栏检查用的相关分必须与用户无关，否则个性化会污染护栏。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GMV 与相关性的平衡护栏","id":"gmv-与相关性的平衡护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两股力量的动态平衡","id":"核心概念-两股力量的动态平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"商业加成的可能来源清单","id":"商业加成的可能来源清单"},{"level":2,"text":"相关性下限的设定","id":"相关性下限的设定"},{"level":2,"text":"长期指标的监控清单","id":"长期指标的监控清单"},{"level":2,"text":"商业与相关性的联合优化","id":"商业与相关性的联合优化"},{"level":2,"text":"与个性化的交互","id":"与个性化的交互"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"导购规则按市场差异化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/global-effectiveness/per-market-merchandising"},"next":{"title":"导购干预效果归因度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-merchandising-personalization/global-effectiveness/merchandising-attribution"}}